	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>Schedule of Classes | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Explore the schedule of classes at Lake Tahoe Community College. Find courses across various disciplines, plan your semester, and advance your education with flexible class options to fit your goals and lifestyle. Enroll now." />
	</ouc:properties>
	
	<ouc:div label="gallery" group="Everyone" button-text="Select Slider">
		<ouc:editor wysiwyg="gallery" csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt"/>		
	</ouc:div>
	
	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><!-- Registration Announcement -->
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
<div style="background-color: #003043; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">🚀 Start Your Next Chapter!</h2>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Summer &amp; Fall registration will open May 18, 2026. Secure your spot today and plan for success in 2026. <strong>Enrollment Services</strong> and <strong>Counseling</strong> are available to help you every step of the way.</p>
<a style="display: inline-block; background-color: #00a3e0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;" title="Learn more about registering at LTCC" href="{{f:72314356}}">Register Now</a></div>
</div>
<!-- Search for Classes -->
<div style="text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 40px;"><strong style="font-size: 28px;">Search for Classes</strong>
<p style="font-size: 18px; margin: 14px 0 20px;">Browse our complete course listings &mdash; updated in real time.</p>
<a style="display: inline-block; background-color: #003352; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;" title="Search for classes at LTCC" href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/Courses/Search">Search for Classes</a>
<p style="font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0 0; color: #444;">Select a <strong>Term</strong> from the dropdown, then filter by <strong>Subject</strong>, <strong>Course Number</strong>, <strong>Day/Time</strong>, or <strong>Instructor</strong>. Use <strong>Advanced Search</strong> for more options.</p>
</div>
<!-- Transition Notice -->
<div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px; background-color: #f4f8fb; border-left: 4px solid #00a3e0; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 4px;">
<p style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0;"><strong>Looking for the printed class schedule?</strong> LTCC has moved to an online self-service system that makes it easier to search, filter, and register for classes in real time. Use the <a title="Search for classes at LTCC" href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/Courses/Search">Search for Classes</a> tool above to browse current offerings.</p>
</div>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;" /><!-- Quarter Dates -->
<div style="text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;"><strong style="font-size: 24px;">Upcoming Quarters</strong>
<p style="font-size: 20px; margin: 20px 0 6px;"><strong>Summer/Fall 2026</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Summer Quarter:</strong> July 6 &ndash; August 14, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; margin: 4px 0 16px;"><strong>Fall Quarter:</strong> September 14 &ndash; December 10, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 20px; margin: 16px 0 6px;"><strong>Spring 2026</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; margin: 4px 0 20px;"><strong>Spring Quarter:</strong> April 6 &ndash; June 25, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;"><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/about/institutional-effectiveness/schedulechangesdashboard.php">View Changes to Schedule</a></p>
</div>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;" /><!-- Types of Courses -->
<div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;"><strong style="font-size: 24px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Types of Courses</strong>
<p style="font-size: 17px;">LTCC courses are offered in multiple formats. Check the class listing for the format of each section before you register.</p>
<ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; padding-left: 24px;">
<li><strong>In-Person</strong> &mdash; Classes meet on campus at scheduled days and times.</li>
<li><strong>Online (Asynchronous)</strong> &mdash; No scheduled meeting times. Coursework is completed on your own schedule through Canvas.</li>
<li><strong>Online (Synchronous)</strong> &mdash; Real-time virtual instruction with mandatory scheduled meeting times. Dates and times are listed in the class search.</li>
<li><strong>Hybrid</strong> &mdash; A mix of in-person and online instruction. Refer to the class listing for specific meeting requirements.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;" /><!-- CCN Note -->
<p style="font-size: 16px; text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px; color: #444;"><strong>Common Course Numbering (CCN):</strong> LTCC is updating course numbers as part of a new statewide system. Look for codes marked with a "C" in the schedule to ensure smooth transfer and degree progress. <a href="{{f:72146407}}">Learn more.</a></p>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;" /><!-- Action Links -->
<p style="font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;"><strong> <a href="https://www.opencccapply.net/gateway/apply?cccMisCode=221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply to LTCC</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register for Classes</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/Courses/Search" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Classes</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="https://ltcc.ecampus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Textbooks</a> </strong></p>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;" /><!-- Need Help -->
<div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 30px;"><strong style="font-size: 24px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Need Help?</strong>
<p style="font-size: 17px; text-align: center;">Our team is here to help you find the right classes and get registered.</p>
<ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; padding-left: 24px;">
<li><strong>Enrollment Services</strong> &mdash; Registration, records, and enrollment support. <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/enrollmentservices.php">Visit Enrollment Services</a></li>
<li><strong>Counseling</strong> &mdash; Help planning your schedule and academic path. <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/counseling.php">Meet with a Counselor</a></li>
<li><strong>Phone:</strong> (530) 541-4660</li>
</ul>
</div>
<hr style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 20px;" /><!-- Student Notice -->
<p style="font-size: 16px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;"><strong>STUDENTS:</strong> Please be aware that your courses may be held virtually in limited circumstances. If that occurs, the College will notify you via <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/health-and-safety/alert-notification-system.php">LTCC Alert</a>. <strong>Please sign up for LTCC Alert.</strong></p></ouc:div>

